# Release signing configuration template.
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL PASSWORDS OR PRODUCTION KEYSTORE FILES TO VERSION CONTROL.
# 
# Option A (Recommended for CI/CD & Production):
# Set the following Environment Variables instead of using this file:
#   ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PATH=/path/to/secure/upload-keystore.jks
#   ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=your_secure_store_password_min_24_chars
#   ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS=upload
#   ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD=your_secure_key_password_min_24_chars
#
# Option B (Local builds only):
# Copy this file to key.properties (or keep it outside the repository via KEY_PROPERTIES_PATH):
#
# storePassword=your_secure_keystore_password
# keyPassword=your_secure_key_password
# keyAlias=upload
# storeFile=/absolute/or/relative/path/to/upload-keystore.jks
